[{"id":2551831691,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6YGdyL","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Feels like a bandaid over a bleeding wound. All these StringName manipulations during blending would probably require some serious scrutinity for the next releases.\r\nI don't know if this cache method does correctly work everywhere, as I don't how the animationTree works, and if some codepath allow a call of `_blend_node` with a different `p_new_parent` without calling make_dirty first, then it will not be correct. And I only see one call to `make_cache_dirty` in the entire file so that is not really reassuring. Cannot Approve nor Request changes ( as maybe it works correctly, if somehow every codepath that leads here with a change is funneled through the only make_dirty call ). Just raising some concern.  ","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#pullrequestreview-2551831691","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101564","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/