l/101564#pullrequestreview-2552938507"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101564"}},"submitted_at":"2025-01-15T14:34:48Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2552949715,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6YKuvT","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Seems more robust like this. ","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#pullrequestreview-2552949715","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101564","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#pullrequestreview-2552949715"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101564"}},"submitted_at":"2025-01-15T14:38:58Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2561174593,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6YqGxB","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"It should be noted that AnimationNode is a resource type. For example, the same AnimationNode may be placed multiple, in which case the path must always be modified, thus caching becomes meaningless; The paths of those replicated AnimationNodes must be unique and should not be cached for the same reference / single AnimationNode entity.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d9c33e7-9d5a-4d4b-89f3-014567b0f997)\r\n\r\nThis is a modified MRP that places the multiple same AnimationNode resource in a BlendTree.\r\n\r\n[perf_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18471402/perf_2.zip)\r\n\r\nThis is similar to why AnimationNode does not have its own current time, store their time in the AnimationTree insteads, see also https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/22887. Also you can refer to the behavior of `AnimationNode::set_parameter()`. So, if we want to cache the AnimationNode path, we would need to have a map in the AnimationTree and store paths there. Then, I think we can monitor the `changed` signal to the AnimationRootNode in the AnimationTree and update those paths at that time.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#pullrequestreview-2561174593","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101564","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101564#pullrequestreview-2561174593"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101564"}},"submitted_at":"2025-01-20T01:43:24Z","commit_id":"205321a5997e4b99c803dd0b0d5344691bce108f"}]